"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":121.63,"end":124.58,"text":"何故... 人は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":124.58,"end":127.58,"text":"断ち切れないのだろう?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":127.84,"end":130.84,"text":"争いを繰り返す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":131.21,"end":134.21,"text":"負の連鎖を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":134.52,"end":137.52,"text":"弱い私は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":137.82999999999998,"end":140.82999999999998,"text":"何を憎めば良い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":141.59,"end":144.59,"text":"嗚呼... やっと解った...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":175.97,"end":178.97,"text":"侵掠者に奪われし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":179.36,"end":182.36,"text":"父祖の地を取り戻せ×","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":182.69,"end":185.69,"text":"侵略者が嗤わせる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":185.94,"end":188.94,"text":"血に塗られたる仔らが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":189.38,"end":192.38,"text":"救済者を貶める","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":192.66,"end":195.66,"text":"異教徒は錆となれ×","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":196.05,"end":199.05,"text":"預言者は神ではない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":199.32999999999998,"end":202.32999999999998,"text":"多神教の偶像","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":202.65,"end":205.65,"text":"侵略する者⇔される者←","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":205.94,"end":208.94,"text":"歴史は繰り返す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":209.31,"end":212.31,"text":"侵略する者⇔される者←","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":212.67000000000002,"end":215.67000000000002,"text":"幾度も繰り返す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":218.87,"end":221.87,"text":"「今モ兄弟同士デ殺シ合ッテイルノカ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":221.92000000000002,"end":224.92000000000002,"text":"人類諸君、我コソガ君達ノ... 敵ダ！ 」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":225.29,"end":228.29,"text":"The Iron forces led by the bronze wolf(黒の軍を率いるは褐色の狼将)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":228.75,"end":231.75,"text":"A very valiant Ishaq(勇者イスハーク)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":231.91,"end":234.91,"text":"The ivory forces led by the battle savvy(白の軍を率いるは歴戦の英雄)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":235.63,"end":238.62,"text":"Holy Knight Ramirez(聖騎士ラミレス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":238.62,"end":240.08,"text":"Victory and justice","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":240.08,"end":242.89,"text":"The Iberian rhapsody","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":242.89,"end":245.89,"text":"Of a warrior's loyalty to his sword","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":247.19,"end":250.19,"text":"「Ishat, huwa lakum malik」【業火、 是汝ノ王デアル】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":251.79,"end":253.43,"text":"《農夫―","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":253.43,"end":255.23,"text":"即チ兄ヨ(エルマノ マジョール)⇔","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":255.23,"end":256.88,"text":"《羊飼―","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":256.88,"end":258.46,"text":"即チ弟ヨ(エルマノ メノール)》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":258.46,"end":261.46,"text":"畏レヨ、 汝、 悪ノ名ヲ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":261.85,"end":264.85,"text":"畏レヨ、 汝、 神ノ仔ラヨ―","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":268.51,"end":271.51,"text":"『聖戦のイベリア』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":295.9,"end":298.33,"text":"「悪魔が去りて後","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":298.33,"end":301.33,"text":"カスティーリャを中心とした 啓典連合王国の成立は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":305.38,"end":308.38,"text":"イベリアにとって長き、聖戦の休止符となり得るだろうか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":312.65,"end":315.65,"text":"故郷を失った我らは流浪に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":318.22,"end":321.22,"text":"ただ歴史を見守り、 歌い継ぐことしかできん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":326.51,"end":329.51,"text":"願わくば、彼方より来たる軍馬の嘶きが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":333.83,"end":336.83,"text":"堅牢なる国境を... ピレネーの頂を越えぬ事を」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}